          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"r2-usage-metrics\">R2 usage metrics</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In this notebook, we will make use of the GraphQL endpoint in order to obtain usage metrics\nrelated to an account's R2 buckets. This will involve the following:<br></span>\n<ul>\n<li>Ranking buckets by number of objects, storage and operations<br></li>\n<li>Plot overall account's usage of R2.</li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Prerequisites:</strong><br></span>\n<ul>\n<li>API token (see <a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/api/get-started/create-token/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>\nfor info on how to create one);<br></li>\n<li>At least one active R2 bucket.<br></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Relevant documentation:<br></span>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/r2/platform/metrics-analytics/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">R2 metrics dev page</a><br></li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
